-## Automatic reasoning selection (OV-045)
-
-Model selection supplies the source-declared valid default effort. If no default is declared and
-there is more than one supported level, the client uses `auto`: this is a client option meaning
-omit the effort patch and let the native provider choose. It is not a wire effort string or a claim
-that maximum effort is always best. A sole supported level remains the only choice. Preserve valid
-explicit preferences; missing/obsolete draft effort is normalized at the existing selection owner.
-Current/frozen requests remain strict about invalid explicit values. Composer, Agent model catalog,
-submission, runtime validation, AI SDK JSON mapping and Pi subscription omission must agree.
