-with a known tier remains unknown quota, never full/zero. A usage period end is not a membership
-expiry or paid billing period. Keep unknown future tier names rather than mapping them to Free.
-Reuse the existing account badge and original plan-status card; known tiers receive established
-semantic color tokens. Original ProviderDetailFeedback and SectionLayout remain byte-identical to
-the pin; only failure copy/classification/manual dismissal differs from upstream.
